                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Super light and fun game. Works perfectly on both my laptop and my RedMagic Pro 11 through the GameHub app. It's super easy to pick up and play for a few minutes since it loads quite quickly and matches usually last less than 3 minutes. It's fun, adicting and the controls are so simple yet the mechanics are so well thought out. I paid like 5 dollars for this and it is absolutely worth it. Also, I kinda want a follow up to this game by the same studio.",
